Gods led by Brahma seek Ravana at Lanka --- Brahma praises son and names him Indrajit --- Indrajit demands immortality for Indra release --- Brahma grants death only through broken fire rite --- Indra goes free and gods return to heaven --- Brahma recalls creation of Ahalya for Gautama --- Indra assaults Ahalya and earns Gautama curse --- Brahma prescribes Vaishnava sacrifice and reveals son alive --- Indra sacrifices and regains heaven rule
